inal four-formula conjecture is false, since the genuine generic count at 𝑛 = 𝑠 = 3 is three, not its
predicted four. The original complex field, symmetry, rank bound, zero-diagonal constraints, bilinear
full-Frobenius metric and all quantifiers remain. The other formulas are not separately settled.
