proof scope identify the correspondence. Exact algebra eliminates interval computations; LeanCert
audits kernel trust. The source comment describing a complete local ring denotes ordinary Localiza-
tion.AtPrime, not an adic completion. Hessian nondegeneracy is proved; no separate scheme-theoretic
multiplicity theorem is claimed.

